              "blocks": {
                "text_7Dagz8": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our leather comes from tanneries in Italy, France, and Germany, and is a byproduct of the meat industry. Exotic leathers follow a separate supply chain: the hides may originate outside Europe and are processed in Italy, always sourced and traded in full compliance with CITES regulations, with documentation available on request.</p><p>All materials are chosen for their durability, beauty, and ability to age gracefully over time. For the full picture of the leathers and hardware we use and how each piece is made, see our <a href=\"https://www.oberndoerferco.com/pages/materials-craftsmanship\" title=\"Materials &amp; Craftsmanship\">Materials &amp; Craftsmanship</a> page.</p>",
